<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25818" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lānŭvĭum</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Länĭv-</span></b> ), ii, n.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town of
				Latium, on the</i> Via Appia, now <i>Cività Lavinia</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Agr.
				2, 35, 96</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Mil. 10, 27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">17,
			45</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Div. 1, 44, 99</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 3,
			29</span></i>; cf. Mann. Ital. 1, p. 635.—Hence,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lānŭvīnus
				(Lānĭv-</span></b> ), a, um, <i>adj., of</i> or <i>belonging to
				Lanuvium, Lanuvian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Div. 1, 36, 79</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 3, 27, 3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">colei,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Fam. 9, 22, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">magistratus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					41, 16</span></i>
			.—<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lā-nŭvīnum</span></b> ,
				i, n., <i>an estate at
				Lanuvium</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Att. 9, 9, 4</span></i>.—<i>Plur.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lānŭvīni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>inhabitants of Lanuvium, Lanuvians</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D.
				1, 29, 82</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Balb. 13, 31</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 6,
			21</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 8, 14 al.</span></i></div>
